# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cash Memer — files git must never carry.
#
# IMPORTANT, read this if you are moving to a new computer:
# everything listed here does NOT come back from `git clone`.
# See the "What a git clone will NOT give you" section of README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Your real secrets. Never tracked. Recreate by hand from .env.example.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Firebase service-account keys — the master key to your whole project.
# These must NEVER be committed. Any JSON that looks like one is blocked here.
*serviceaccount*.json
*service-account*.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
firebase-key.json
secrets/

# Installed packages — recreated by `npm install`
node_modules/

# Your shop's database, drafts and backup snapshots — recreated only from
# your own JSON export. Git will NOT save these for you.
data/

# Self-signed HTTPS certificate — regenerated automatically on next start
certs/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
npm-debug.log*
